# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored via the *.local rule) and fill in.

# Mapbox spike only — /archive-mapbox. The shipping Story and Archive do not
# read this and keep working without it.
#
# Vite inlines any VITE_-prefixed variable into the client bundle, so this
# token is PUBLIC by construction. That is how Mapbox tokens are meant to work
# (CF's is readable in their bundle too), but it means the protection is a URL
# restriction on the token in the Mapbox account, not secrecy. Restrict it to
# the production domain plus the Vercel preview wildcard before using it
# anywhere but localhost.
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
